  "description": "Below is the current inventory of export templates you can run from the\u202f/api/v1/exports\u202fendpoint.  \n\n- **Daily Customer List Export** \u2013 ID\u202f10234 \u2013 generated from a **search**\u2011type list. The export is produced in **Comma\u2011Separated Values** format with a MIME type of\u202ftext/csv;charset=iso-8859-1.  \n- **Weekly Sales Report** \u2013 ID\u202f20567 \u2013 based on an **all**\u2011type list. This report is delivered as a **Microsoft Excel** file, MIME type\u202fapplication/vnd.ms-excel.  \n- **Archived Logs Archive** \u2013 ID\u202f30987 \u2013 created from a **clipboard**\u2011type list. It outputs **Comma\u2011Separated Values in Multiple Files**, packaged as a ZIP archive with MIME type\u202fapplication/zip."
